claim.claim-text:
storing a local ledger at the charging points and or the battery logic;
detecting a charging event associated with a rechargeable battery being connected to a charging point for metered charging or discharging;
forming a hash value of the event details from a credential associated with the rechargeable battery and a credential associated with the charging point;
updating the ledger at the charging point and or the battery logic with the hash value and a timestamp of the event.
